"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"The value of the `quarkus-dev-service-elasticsearch` label attached to the "
"started container.\n"
"\n"
"This property is used when `shared` is set to `true`. In this case, before "
"starting a container, Dev Services for Elasticsearch looks for a container "
"with the `quarkus-dev-service-elasticsearch` label set to the configured "
"value. If found, it will use this container instead of starting a new one. "
"Otherwise it starts a new container with the `quarkus-dev-service-"
"elasticsearch` label set to the specified value.\n"
"\n"
"This property is used when you need multiple shared Elasticsearch servers.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
